 lines=['# V177 three-cycle exercise','', '**Outcome: REFERENCE_NOT_QUALIFIED.** Both same-graph BPTT references failed the frozen feasibility thresholds. BS/BR candidate training was therefore not executed. This is not evidence that local credit failed.','', '| World | Held bits/token | Gain vs UNI | Accuracy | Exact8 | Post-newline EOS |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
